1 NAME Thomas /Konow/ Eidsvollsmann
2 GIVN Thomas
2 NSFX Eidsvollsmann
2 _MARNM Konow
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 10 OCT 1796
2 ADDR
3 CITY Bergen
3 STAE Hordaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 BAPM
2 DATE 16 OCT 1796
2 PLAC Nykirken
2 ADDR
