3 CTRY Norway
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Annette Cathrine Hedvig Collett 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gift med: Lorentz Henschien
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Cathrine Hedvig Collett was born on 13th January 1801.  She married Lorentz Henschien a solicitor at law from Akershus and they had one son and three daughters.  Lorentz was born on 2nd February 1786 and he died on 11th Augus
2 CONC t 1857 four months before his wife Anne, who died on 19th December 1857.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Cathrine Hedevig Collett, f. i Christianssand 13 Jan. 1801,
2 CONT
2 CONT f paa Hoen paa Eker 19 Dec. 1867; * paa Modum 23 Sept. 1822 Prokurator Lorentz Henschien, f. i Sandsvær 2 Febr. 1786, f paa sin Eiendom Hoen 11 Aug. 1867, Søn af Stiger ved Kongsbergs Sølwerk H. J. Henschien og Hustru Gjertrud Joh
2 CONC annesdatter. Han tog 1810 dansk juridisk Examen og fik 8 Sept. 1813 Bevilling som Prokurator ved Over- og Underretterne i Akershus Stift; 4 Børn.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Barn===
2 CONT
2 CONT # Eilertine Lorentze Henschien - 15 Dec 1822 - Eiker
2 CONT #
2 CONT #
2 CONT #
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Kilder===
2 CONT
